  "{:trigger \"cloud-itonami-isic-6493 (factoring actor) and its Cloudflare Worker deployment need REAL, standards-accurate banking capability libraries to eventually wire into (no live bank connection attached — that requires licensed-institution credentials, out of scope to fabricate)\",
    :research {:primary \"Berlin Group NextGenPSD2 XS2A Framework, Implementation Guidelines + OpenAPI definition v1.3.11 (2021-09-24)\",
               :primary-source \"https://github.com/adorsys/xs2a/blob/develop/xs2a-impl/src/main/resources/static/psd2-api_v1.3.11-2021-10-01v1.yaml (14069 lines, fetched and read in full, not recalled from training data)\",
               :cross-check-source \"https://docs-nextgenpsd2.api.memo.bank/operation/operation-initiatepayment (live ASPSP generated docs — field list matched exactly, supplied the tppMessages code catalog the OpenAPI schema itself leaves as a free string)\",
               :why-berlin-group \"fits this fleet's existing multi-jurisdiction facts-catalog convention — cloud-itonami-isic-6419's banking.facts already cites BaFin for the DEU jurisdiction\",
               :secondary-documented-not-implemented [\"UK Open Banking (OBIE) Payment Initiation API domestic-payments\" \"Japan 全銀協 銀行分野のオープンAPIに係る電文仕様標準\"]},
    :covered [\"POST /v1/payments/{payment-product} single payment-initiation request/response, 4 JSON-bodied payment products\"
              \"real 14-value transactionStatus enum (RCVD/PDNG/ACTC/ACSC/RJCT/ACCC/ACCP/ACSP/ACWC/ACWP/CANC/ACFC/PATC/PART)\"
              \"tppMessages-shaped 4xx error body\"
              \"GET /v1/accounts, GET /v1/accounts/{account-id}/balances account information\"
              \"wired to/from existing kotoba.banking account record + iban-valid?, not a duplicate data model\"],
    :not-covered [\"consent management (/v1/consents)\" \"any SCA flow (redirect/OAuth2/decoupled/embedded)\" \"bulk/periodic payments\" \"payment cancellation\" \"transaction list\" \"card accounts\" \"pain.001-XML payment products\" \"UK OBIE / Japan 全銀協 spec-conformant implementation (documented only)\"],
    :landing {:child-repo \"kotoba-lang/banking main advanced to 73ac6d2fc2d26a93e1924fb0a61881d7ea859a08 via fresh sibling clone + feature branch + server-side merge (gh api .../merges, no local rebase, no force-push); CI green\",
              :tests \"90 new assertions (53 -> 143 total), all green; clj-kondo introduces zero new warnings\",
              :manifest-pin \"manifest/west.yml banking entry revision advanced via single-entry GitHub API PUT (blob-SHA-matched, one-line diff), pre-verified pure fast-forward via compare API (ahead_by 6, behind_by 0)\",
